SUMMARY:Panigiri of Metamorfosi Sotiros\, Othos & Aperi
LOCATION:Othos\, Karpathos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Othos\, the highest village on Karpathos\, and neighbouring Aperi both celebrate the Transfiguration on 5-6 August with vespers\, communal food and dancing to lyra. Go up on the evening of the 5th\; the two villages are five minutes apart\, so you can do both.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/karpathos/#othos-panigiri-of-metamorfosi-sotiros-othos-aperi
